<title>USA: Fluor names Conaway senior VP.</title>
<headline>Fluor names Conaway senior VP.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fluor Corp said J. Michal Conaway, 48, was promoted to the position of senior vice president in addition to his title as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Conaway joined Fluor in 1993 as vice president of finance and was promoted to chief financial officer in June 1994, the company said.</p>
